notes.content:
NEW! Blitz mode for 4x4 and 8x8 fields: you have only 2 minutes to get best score;
Added leaderboards to compete with other players and friends;
Fixed bug that prevented unlocking achievements;
The version for Mac OSX platform is no longer supported, and wont be updated;

Version 1.3.5 what's new:
[list]
[*] Gem Breaker, Chain Breaker, and Tornado removed from the game's item store;
[*] inventory items are organised in stacks when the game is running;
[*] added new inventory item -- item box; the item box is dropped every time after Game Over 
when drop time limits are satisfied; the item box can be opened and contains 3 random items;
[*] added game status in Steam Chat when friends are playing; 
[*] added arrows below the game field to indicate possible moves: GREEN IS GOOD, RED IS BAD; 
[*] added collectable skins for gems that can be crafted 

[url=https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/26693475/460bb5627ac829de5aa1f29904d6e5f8e1342fbe.jpg][img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/26693475/00c3c2ede273dfb6b68adb7486dea2ae51b4bd7f.jpg[/img][/url]

Version 1.3.3 what's new:
[list]
[*] fixed bug when music volume at 0% doesn't mute the music;
[*] added gems merging rules in the main menu (just wait a bit in the main menu to see them);
[/list]

Version 1.3.0 what's new:
[list]
[*]  added new game mode on the 8x8 field 
[*]  14 new achievements are ready to be unlocked;
[*]  gems are now moving faster;
[*]  new music track! is available for those players who unlocked all achievements in 4x4-mode; once unlocked, music tracks can be switched any time in Settings;
[/list]

Version 1.2.0 what's new:
[list]
[*] fixed bug with achievements and score on Mac;
[*] now gems can be merged several times with a single move;
[*] player high score is now stored on Steam;
[*] added animated flame effect instead of static image;
[/list]
